Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:47.07,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\yshad2\fnFZYaSong-B-GBK\fs48\fsp5\c&H7F6B20&\4c&HD4B288&\pos(488,365)}你果然看到了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.27,0:09:49.28,Screen_Date,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,950)\an2\fs55\pos(1420,442)}6月12日　（星期五）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:14.43,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(220,0)\an2\c&H6A80DB&\1a&H30&\pos(960,905)\clip(558,840,1335,906)}感覺你好像沒什麼精神，怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:25.02,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZYaSong-B-GBK\fs48\fsp15\c&H7A6921&\pos(558,332)\t(1859,2902,\c&H0B1113&)}沒什麼
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.97,0:13:43.47,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur8\bord2\fnFZYaSong-DB-GBK\c&HE4D09A&\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H90&\pos(960,588)}我的身體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.22,0:13:48.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur8\bord2\fnFZYaSong-DB-GBK\fsp7\c&HEFDFB1&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(995,614)}你覺得能買嗎{\fsp0}？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fnFZYouSong GBK 509R\fs55\pos(960,771)\t(50,50,\c&HB9AEA5&)}我過於集中在聲音上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.63,0:17:02.38,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fnFZYouSong GBK 509R\fs55\c&HD0C8C2&\pos(960,799)}我太大意了 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.63,0:17:06.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fs55\c&HF0F2F4&\pos(960,802)\t(50,50,\c&H858FB0&)}英語聽力嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:09.13,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fnFZYouSong GBK 509R\fs55\c&HFAFCFA&\pos(960,808)\t(50,50,\c&HB9AEA5&)}這…這也沒什麼吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.88,0:22:44.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fnFZYouSong GBK 509R\fs50\c&HA3896C&\pos(960,836)}湯汁蛋卷和吐司一起吃很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:44.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur15\bord1\fnFZYouSong GBK 509R\fs50\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&\pos(960,836)}湯汁蛋捲和吐司一起吃很奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.64,0:22:46.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fs50\c&H646A8C&\pos(960,836)}不奇怪哦，綾瀨
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.47,0:22:47.51,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur1\fs50\c&H8D91B5&\pos(960,798)}我很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:47.51,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8\blur20\bord1\fnFZYouSong GBK 509R\fs50\3c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HFF&\pos(960,798)}我很開心
